expect: RISK WORKLIST
expect: q back
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/worklist_reading.py @TMP_TARGET @ART deep-reading deep
ask: Can the operator read complete ranked paths, source limits, omissions and contributor states by paging at every size without clipped evidence?
resize: 120x36
submit: run worklist:rank
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 no risk worklist | default-no-deep
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deep_worklist.py @TMP_TARGET @ART default
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 no risk worklist | default-empty-40x12
expect: RISK WORKLIST · Tab
expect: q back
resize: 120x36
submit: run worklist:rank {"deep":true,"limit":500}
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 Deep inspection: partial | deep-restored
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deep_worklist.py @TMP_TARGET @ART deep-again
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: worklist
require-live-snap: 25 Deep inspection: partial | retained-inspection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deep_worklist.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the exact saved deep result and its limits without reranking, building a graph or creating model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
